; Experimental redeemer for RewardLifecycleProbe, not the V1 checkpoint/module ABI.
; Semantic constraints depend on purpose and withdrawal amount.
reward-lifecycle-redeemer = int
; Certifying: only deposit-bearing script stake registration; redeemer = -1.
; Rewarding, amount = 0: redeemer = -1; no receipt.
; Rewarding, amount > 0: 0 <= redeemer < output count; receipt at that index.
; Exactly one withdrawal; authority required signer; fixed full key-address sink.
; Receipt: ADA >= withdrawn amount, no other assets, no datum/reference script.
; Scalar canonical CBOR vectors: -1 -> 20; 0 -> 00; 1 -> 01.
